       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. ABBREVS.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 A PIC 9 VALUE 3.
       01 B PIC 9 VALUE 1.
       01 C PIC 9 VALUE 3.
       01 D PIC 9 VALUE 5.
       01 X PIC X VALUE "Q".
       01 Y PIC X VALUE "Q".
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       MAIN-PARA.
           IF A = B OR C DISPLAY "1 YES" ELSE DISPLAY "1 NO" END-IF
           IF A = B OR D DISPLAY "2 YES" ELSE DISPLAY "2 NO" END-IF
           IF A < D AND C DISPLAY "3 YES" ELSE DISPLAY "3 NO" END-IF
           IF A = C AND NOT D DISPLAY "4 YES" ELSE DISPLAY "4 NO" END-IF
           IF A > B AND < D AND NOT C DISPLAY "5 YES"
               ELSE DISPLAY "5 NO" END-IF
           IF X = "Z" OR Y DISPLAY "6 YES" ELSE DISPLAY "6 NO" END-IF
           IF A = 1 OR 2 OR C OR 4 DISPLAY "7 YES"
               ELSE DISPLAY "7 NO" END-IF
           STOP RUN.
